# WRONG-1 regression: associator verdict must use the scale of each component,
# not an absolute norm cutoff (quaternions and associative octonion subalgebras)
associator 100.1+i, 100.2+j, 100.3+k
associator 1000.1+e1, 1000.2+e2, 1000.3+e3
associator (1+i)/3, (1+j)/7, (1+k)/11
# genuine non-associativity, including when other components are huge
associator e1, e2, e4
associator e1/1000, e2/1000, e4/1000
associator 1000000000+e1, 1000000000+e2, 1000000000+e4
